# Root build-context ALLOWLIST. Only the ops-controller image builds with the repo ROOT as
# its context (docker/ops-controller.Dockerfile COPYs ordo/ catalog/ plugins/ agents/
# dashboards/); everything else is excluded so the context stays tiny and no operator
# material (out/secrets.env, auth/caddy/certs/, data/, models/) can ever reach the daemon.
# (Subdirectory build contexts — docker/*/, dashboard/, hermes/, worker/, … — are NOT
# affected: a .dockerignore only applies to the context directory it sits in.)
*
!ordo/
!catalog/
!plugins/
!agents/
!dashboards/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
